@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "UsersPage / usersApi" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "UsersController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "UserService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "UserRepository / RefreshTokenRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "User / RefreshToken" as P4 <<entity>>
note over P0,P4: Actor: Admin. Authorize account management first.
P0 -> P1: Submit account changes
P1 -> P2: Check account changes
P2 -> P3: Load target account
P3 --> P2: Account found or missing
P2 -> P4: Read account access
alt self-demotion, self-deactivation or duplicate email
P2 --> P1: Reject the update
P1 --> P0: Display the conflict
else valid update changes account access
P2 -> P4: Apply account changes
P2 -> P3: Save and revoke sessions
note over P2,P4: Save access changes and revoke sessions together. Metadata-only updates do not revoke sessions.
P3 --> P2: Confirm the commit
P2 --> P1: Return account details
P1 --> P0: Display updated account
end
@enduml